  "prefLabel": "Env-C 214.03 Federal Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 214.03 Federal Definitions. For purposes of this part, the following terms shall be as defined in 40 CFR §3.3, reprinted in Appendix B:\n\n(a) “Authorized program”;\n\n(b) “Copy of record”;\n\n(c) “Electronic document”;\n\n(d) “Electronic document receiving system”;\n\n(e) “Electronic signature”;\n\n(f) “Electronic signature agreement”;\n\n(g) “Electronic signature device”;\n\n(h) “Federal program”;\n\n(i) “Federal reporting requirement”;\n\n(j) “Handwritten signature”;\n\n(k) “Subscriber agreement”;\n\n(l) “Transmit”; and\n\n(m) “Valid electronic signature”.\n\nSource. #12880, eff 9-30-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-c200.html"
